synaplot began as a fork of PlotNeuralNet and remains built on its work. The
TikZ pic definitions that draw every box, banded box, and ball in a synaplot
diagram originate there. They live in src/synaplot/tex/ and each file carries a
header naming the original and describing what synaplot changed.

The Python interface, the specification format, the rendering pipeline, and the
command-line interface are new work.

If you use synaplot in academic work, please cite both projects. See
CITATION.cff for the details.
